          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Last spring, six students from Spain started a small sports club. They asked their friends to help, fixed the old desks, and sent texts to the school. In the first months, they played twelve matches and made the strongest team in the street.",
